    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56241" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καυσᾰλίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, prob. glossed by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ μέλαινα καὶ ὑπέρυθρος</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καύσαλις</span> cod.); perh. to be
		read for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καυκαλίς</span>, of a kind of
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμύρνα</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Dsc.
			1.64
		</span></i> (and so in <i><span class="en">
			Orib.
			12
		</span></i> s.v.), and for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καυχαλίς</span> (q.v.).</div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
